   "title": "A Sentry Needs Both Feet",
   "turnin": "r20_orc_capital_envoy",
   "xp": 585
  },
  {
   "copper": 19,
   "description": "Speargrass Wellhold keeps sending us spears. Brakka Jarward wants word back, and you look ready for a walk. Travel to the Wellhold in Speargrass Reach and speak to Brakka for me. If Brakka asks about my stew, say the bowls come back empty.",
   "giver": "r20_orc_capital_cook",
   "giver_name": "Gorla Longladle",
   "giver_settlement": "Gor Drazhak",
   "id": "gor_drazhak_dispatch_01",
   "min_level": 21,
   "objectives": [
