   "turnin": "r20_orc_capital_cook",
   "xp": 580
  },
  {
   "copper": 58,
   "description": "Kill eight Dustpack Hyenas by day in the Gor Drazhak Badlands, east of Gor Drazhak, and keep our supply carts moving. They follow the rations as though we packed lunch for them; if they want a meal from the Throng, they can learn to carry a spear.",
