  },
  {
   "copper": 83,
   "description": "Bandit Ration-Broker Garr buys Korr's stolen supplies and charges hungry fighters for the privilege of getting them back. At the Gor Drazhak Tollcamp, southeast of Gor Drazhak, kill six Toll Bandit Archers and Garr himself. The hands that fill our war bands' bowls deserve better than this.",
   "giver": "r20_orc_capital_envoy",
