  {
   "copper": 19,
   "description": "You have seen what it takes to keep the Throng fed and marching. Now report to Drek Rampbinder at Red Ramp Post on Bannerbreak Mesa, where our fighters hold the line. Stand with them as you stood for the people behind these walls.",
