  {
   "copper": 240,
   "description": "Gor Drazhak did not build a road through two front lines just to watch our wardens get buried beside it. Bring me two Scorch Venom from the Sinkmire Vipers by day in the Causeway Reedmire, which lies in the southeast of The Broken Causeway. Our archers have volunteered to handle the arrows; funny how nobody volunteered for the snakes.",
