   "copper": 360,
   "description": "A recruit ought to wear a fang before a fang wears the recruit. Kill four Warpack Hyenas by day in the Shattered Line Trenches, which lie in the west of The Shattered Line, and bring me two Siegepack Fangs for the next recruits sent to the front.",
